  "question": {
    "text": "The resistance of a wire is $5 \\Omega$. It's new resistance in ohm if stretched to 5 times of its original length will be :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "zfiha",
      "text": "625",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "9mLDG",
      "text": "5",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DQOBT",
      "text": "125",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "rZE21",
      "text": "25",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/AHskDoEY5sab6S_juKuP1x9Cv9AcAlJ_pFWfMJGRGiM.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Let resistance of a wire $R$ and length 1 .<br />$\\mathrm{R}=\\frac{\\rho \\ell}{\\mathrm{A}}=5 \\Omega$<br />$\\therefore \\quad$ Volume of wire is constant in stretching<br />$V_i=V_f \\Rightarrow A_i \\ell_i=A_f \\ell_f$<br />$\\mathrm{A} \\ell=\\mathrm{A}^{\\prime}(5 \\ell) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{A}^{\\prime}=\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{5}$<br />$R_f=\\frac{\\rho \\ell_f}{A_f}=\\frac{\\rho(5 \\ell)}{\\left(\\frac{A}{5}\\right)}=25\\left(\\frac{\\rho \\ell}{A}\\right)=25 \\times 5=125 \\Omega$",
    "image": null
  },
